<Defs>
    <MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeCategoryDef>
        <defName>MX_QH_Category_Qinghe</defName>
        <label>花神恩典</label>
        <description>清荷的技能类别，随花神之恩典等级自动解锁。</description>
        <displayOrder>0</displayOrder>
    </MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeCategoryDef>

    <MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>
        <defName>MX_QH_Node_FlowerEnvoy</defName>
        <label>花神使</label>
        <description>清荷身为花神使的根基：莲华护盾常伴身侧，涓流抚平旧伤，花神之垂怜守候于将殒之际。\n\n——初始习得飞花令：春泉涌流、霜月镜，与剑技：镜花水月。</description>
        <category>MX_QH_Category_Qinghe</category>
        <iconPath>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/MX_Neiyu_ThunderMarkedStorm</iconPath>
        <displayOrder>0</displayOrder>
        <requiredGraceLevel>0</requiredGraceLevel>
        <grantedAbilities>
            <li>MX_QH_SpringFlow</li>
            <li>MX_QH_LunarMirror</li>
            <li>MX_QH_IllusoryReflection</li>
        </grantedAbilities>
    </MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>

    <MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>
        <defName>MX_QH_Node_Jueying</defName>
        <label>剑舞</label>
        <description>清荷与老师霓羽交流后领悟的剑技，以铃音化为剑气，兼有剑势·天坠的惊人速度和清荷独特的斩击技巧。\n\n——习得剑技：必杀剑：落樱。向指定方向高速冲刺，命中目标后借力跃起并追击；落下时消耗全部剑压发动7次强力斩击，剑压不足1层时也可发动，但斩击的次数和威力将大幅削弱。</description>
        <category>MX_QH_Category_Qinghe</category>
        <iconPath>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/MX_Neiyu_ThunderMarkedStorm</iconPath>
        <displayOrder>30</displayOrder>
        <requiredGraceLevel>5</requiredGraceLevel>
        <grantedAbilities>
            <li>MX_QH_AscentSlash</li>
        </grantedAbilities>
    </MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>

    <MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>
        <defName>MX_QH_Node_Luoshenfu</defName>
        <label>洛水之仪</label>
        <description>洛水之上，神女证誓。\n\n——习得被动特性：洛水之仪。清荷若已有配偶，将与对方缔结洛神契，双方心绪安宁；缘分未至时，亦心有所待。</description>
        <category>MX_QH_Category_Qinghe</category>
        <iconPath>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/MX_Neiyu_ThunderMarkedStorm</iconPath>
        <displayOrder>40</displayOrder>
        <requiredGraceLevel>1</requiredGraceLevel>
    </MiliraXian.Characters.SkillNodeDef>

